[59.922085, "o", "75:\"\"\"Type of downstream containers.\"\"\"\r\n802:        If we re-used a window ID, it's possible a downstream join\r\n972:        :returns: Any values to emit downstream. Values will\r\n988:        :returns: Any values to emit downstream. Values will\r\n998:        :returns: Any values to emit downstream. Values will\r\n1194:class WindowOut(Generic[V, W_co]):\r\n1197:    down: KeyedStream[Tuple[int, W_co]]\r\n1207:    `down` or `meta` streams, depending on the specifics of the\r\n1323:    downs: KeyedStream[Tuple[int, W]] = op.filter_map_value(\r\n1324:        \"unwrap_down\",\r\n1338:    return WindowOut(downs, lates, metas)\r\n1513:                                    windowed.down, to_uppercase_and_flatten)\r\n1641:    formatted = op.map(\"format_output\", windowed.down, format_output)\r\n1798:    op.inspect(\"output\", windowed.down)\r\n2247:    \"\"\"Distill all values for a key down into a single value.\r\n"]
