[155.981136, "o", "19:class Sink(ABC, Generic[X]):  # noqa: B024\r\n22:    Base class for all output sinks. Do not subclass this.\r\n24:    If you want to implement a custom connector, instead subclass one\r\n32:class StatefulSinkPartition(ABC, Generic[X, S]):\r\n36:    def write_batch(self, values: List[X]) -> None:\r\n52:    def snapshot(self) -> S:\r\n69:    def close(self) -> None:\r\n80:class FixedPartitionedSink(Sink[Tuple[str, X]], Generic[X, S]):\r\n90:    def list_parts(self) -> List[str]:\r\n100:    def part_fn(self, item_key: str) -> int:\r\n130:    def build_part(\r\n161:class StatelessSinkPartition(ABC, Generic[X]):\r\n165:    def write_batch(self, items: List[X]) -> None:\r\n177:    def close(self) -> None:\r\n188:class DynamicSink(Sink[X]):\r\n197:    def build(\r\n"]
[155.981462, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@97c5c4c0-869e-45e9-beba-01256e290bbb:~# "]
